  <item>
    <title>2025戛纳电影节Day 1：脾气暴躁的一天</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6823c99a24f85593467531b7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6823c99a24f85593467531b7</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 May 2025 23:04:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>抱歉前13分钟录音设备出了问题，音质有点糟糕。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="23">00:23</a> 今年尝试一下新形式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a> 经典修复单元的《淘金记》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="202">03:22</a> 开幕片《启程之日》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="247">04:07</a> 为啥我的精神状态出了问题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">04:46</a> 想念和我一起在德彪西厅抢位置的那个她</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a> 看完开幕式后的一些闲聊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="578">09:38</a> 正式开始开幕片大讨论（有剧透）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 和某品牌的PR大吵一架</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1163">19:23</a> 《淘金记》和开幕片有什么关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">20:57</a> 明天看什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1639">27:19</a> 预测本届场刊评分最低会是哪一部</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1749">29:09</a> 预告吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1843">30:43</a> 毕赣场刊评分会高吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">32:28</a> 嘟嘟熊回来了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2268">37:48</a> 盘点本届戛纳周边</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2483">41:23</a> 《狂野时代》和《风林火山》的新片段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2634">43:54</a> 为什么本届戛纳有两部华语电影的主创不接受采访？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6236cb6d2fe19c8207e5d37e/lpAY617CteqYRKefrL6B9jL-kIiG.m4a" length="90308457" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:46:46</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm7o8JdjF_lKwdtJ8UpStkRtPYoN.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>戛纳DayX：复盘颁奖结果+马后炮</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66526b854efbc0c3dc0b6b77</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66526b854efbc0c3dc0b6b77</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 25 May 2024 22:51:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="87">01:27</a> 最佳剧本《某种物质》很离谱？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="319">05:19</a> 最佳女演员《艾米莉娅》集体打包</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="424">07:04</a> 最佳男演员《善良的种类》普莱蒙实至名归</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">08:47</a> 拉索洛夫被“特别奖”打发引起最大争议</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="867">14:27</a> 特邀嘉宾畅聊《神圣无花果之种》的不足之处</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1773">29:33</a>《某种物质》是否厌女？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> 为肖恩贝克《阿诺拉》辩护</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2233">37:13</a> “特别奖”的乌龙事件</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2305">38:25</a> 真的有必要再给欧迪亚颁发一座评审团奖吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2662">44:22</a> 给《壮游》导演戈麦斯的最佳导演奖颁得太好了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2785">46:25</a> 从颁奖结果揣测格蕾塔·葛韦格的偏好和标准</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3068">51:08</a> 对整个颁奖结果的最终感受</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3167">52:47</a> 获奖片中哪些能在国内影展/院线看到？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3263">54:23</a> 明年预告</span></p>]]></description>
